msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「After that, I didn't show my face to＿anyone......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Después de eso, no me dejé＿ver por nadie......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Hey, Inko-chan, do I really have to＿go to school?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Oye, Inko-chan, ¿de verdad＿tengo que ir a la escuela?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「SCHOO...... SCUBA?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¿ESCUE...... ESCUELA DE BUCEO?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, not scuba...... *Sigh*～ I feel like＿crap.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, de buceo no...... *Suspiro*～＿Me siento fatal.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Huhhh～? Why's Ryuu-chan in＿uniformmm～?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Ehhh～? ¿Por qué Ryuu-chan＿lleva el uniformeee～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What, you're already awake? I told you＿last night that school starts today.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué, ya despertaste? Anoche te dije＿que hoy empiezan las clases.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Oh reallyyy...... *Yawn*～......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ah, ¿en seriooo......? *Bostezo*～......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I prepared food for you, like always......＿Oh, I'm out of time. I'm heading out.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Te dejé comida, como siempre......＿Ah, ya se me hace tarde. Me voy.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Okaaay～ Have a good dayyy.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Está bieeen～ Que te vaya bieeen.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......\"Not showing my face to anyone\"＿meant Kushieda (of course), Kitamura＿and the guys, and also Taiga as well.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......\"No me dejé ver por nadie\":＿Kushieda (claro), Kitamura y los＿demás, y también Taiga.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No matter what I did, I couldn't think of＿what I should say to anyone.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hiciera lo que hiciera, no se me＿ocurría qué decirle a nadie.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yesterday, I got a single email from＿Taiga.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ayer recibí un solo correo de Taiga.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then technically I did speak to＿someone once yesterday...... If you can＿call it that, then yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Técnicamente, ayer sí hablé con＿alguien una vez...... Si se le＿puede llamar así, sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「She'd bluntly written \"Starting＿tomorrow, don't come get me in the＿morning.\"」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Escribió sin rodeos: \"Desde mañana, no＿vengas a buscarme por la mañana\".」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Here I am...... *Sigh*～」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya llegué...... *Suspiro*～」"

msgid "Minori「Just then, I saw it!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡Entonces, lo vi!!」"

msgid "Both「......!」"
msgstr "Ambos「......!」"

msgid "Minori「......It was a mountain of untouched＿winter break homework!!」"
msgstr "Minori「......¡¡Era una montaña de tareas de＿vacaciones de invierno sin hacer!!」"

msgid "Haruta「NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!」"
msgstr "Haruta「¡¡NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!」"

msgid "Taiga「STOOOP!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡PARAAA!」"

msgid "Noto「Hey Takasu......」"
msgstr "Noto「Oye, Takasu......」"

msgid "Noto「You know, doesn't it feel a little too＿\"status quo\" up in here?」"
msgstr "Noto「Oye, ¿no sientes que aquí todo＿sigue \"igual que siempre\"?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You think so?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Tú crees?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What do you expect? Of course I＿finished my homework.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué esperabas? Claro que＿terminé mi tarea.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......No, frankly, things are a little＿different for me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No, la verdad, para mí las＿cosas son algo distintas.」"

msgid "Noto「Hmmm, so that means they're the ones＿maintaining the 'quo.」"
msgstr "Noto「Hmmm, entonces ellos son＿los que siguen igual.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí.」"

msgid "Noto「So you see, I think we definitely need＿some change up in here, man.」"
msgstr "Noto「Por eso creo que aquí necesitamos＿un cambio, amigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nah, I don't want you to do anything＿right now.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no quiero que hagas nada por ahora.」"

msgid "Noto「No no no, you're forgetting a critical＿event, Takasu.」"
msgstr "Noto「No, no, no, olvidas un evento＿crucial, Takasu.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Noto「......Are you playing dumb? The biggest＿event we've seen, of course.」"
msgstr "Noto「......¿Te haces el tonto? El evento más＿grande que hemos tenido, claro.」"

msgid "Haruta「The! School! Trip! In! O-KI-NA-WA!」"
msgstr "Haruta「¡El! ¡Viaje! ¡Escolar! ¡A! ¡O-KI-NA-WA!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, it's that time already?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ¿ya es hora?」"

msgid "Noto「YES, OKINAWA!」"
msgstr "Noto「¡SÍ, OKINAWA!」"

msgid "Haruta「THAT'S OKINAWA!」"
msgstr "Haruta「¡ASÍ ES, OKINAWA!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Of course, Okinawa! Crap, I'd totally＿forgotten about it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Claro, Okinawa! Rayos, lo había＿olvidado por completo.」"

msgid "Haruta「What～? An effect of your amnesia,＿dude?」"
msgstr "Haruta「¿Qué～? ¿Un efecto de tu amnesia, amigo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, it probably just slipped my mind,＿that's all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, seguro se me pasó, nada más.」"

msgid "Noto「What? Don't tell me you don't feel like＿going! Is that it?」"
msgstr "Noto「¿Qué? ¡No me digas que no tienes＿ganas de ir! ¿Es eso?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Of course not.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro que no.」"

msgid "Haruta「What～? Then why don't you look＿happy?」"
msgstr "Haruta「¿Qué～? ¿Entonces por qué＿no te ves feliz?」"

msgid "Noto「Come on, that's enough cleaning for＿now.」"
msgstr "Noto「Vamos, ya basta de limpiar por ahora.」"

msgid "Haruta「Now then, c'mon, let's think about it～」"
msgstr "Haruta「Bueno, vamos, pensemos en eso～」"

msgid "Noto「Clear skies! Sunshine that never quits!＿The shining blue OCEAN!」"
msgstr "Noto「¡Cielos despejados! ¡Sol sin fin!＿¡El MAR azul brillante!」"

msgid "Haruta「Mongooses～! Sugarcane! Island＿pickles～!」"
msgstr "Haruta「¡Mangostas～! ¡Caña de azúcar!＿¡Encurtidos isleños～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, oh, ooh!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡Ah, ah, ahh!」"

msgid "Noto「Enveloped in the uninhibited＿atmosphere of traveling, her heart is＿sure to be open!」"
msgstr "Noto「¡Con el ambiente relajado del viaje,＿seguro que ella abrirá su corazón!」"

msgid "Haruta「Notocchi, I'm not sure about＿encouraging that～」"
msgstr "Haruta「Notocchi, no sé si deberías＿fomentar eso～」"

msgid "Noto「R-Really? Well anyway, it's gonna be＿awesome!」"
msgstr "Noto「¿E-En serio? Bueno, ¡será genial!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You're right, the school trip is the＿perfect chance!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡Tienen razón, el viaje escolar＿es la oportunidad perfecta!」"

msgid "Haruta「Ohh, good～! Okay, let's try this one＿more time～」"
msgstr "Haruta「¡Ohh, qué bien～! Bueno, una vez más～」"

msgid "Noto「Alright, here we go!」"
msgstr "Noto「¡Bien, allá vamos!」"

msgid "Noto「YES, OKINAWA!」"
msgstr "Noto「¡SÍ, OKINAWA!」"

msgid "Haruta「THAT'S OKINAWA!」"
msgstr "Haruta「¡ASÍ ES, OKINAWA!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「LET'S GO, OKINAWA!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡ALLÁ VAMOS, OKINAWA!」"

msgid "Everyone「YAY～!」"
msgstr "Todos「¡SÍÍÍ～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「My \"perfect chance\" was different from＿what they'd imagined, for sure.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Seguro que mi \"oportunidad perfecta\"＿no era lo que ellos imaginaban.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「When I'm there, I thought, surely I'll＿want to speak honestly from the heart.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pensé que, una vez allá, querría hablar＿con sinceridad, desde el corazón.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「As for that special southern island＿destination, a faint hope burgeoned in＿me......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Aquel destino tan especial,＿esa isla del sur, me dio una＿leve esperanza......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Until, with a bitter expression, our＿homeroom teacher brought it up.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hasta que nuestra profesora lo mencionó＿con una expresión amarga.」"

msgid "Yuri「Hello. First of all, perhaps I should＿thank you for your hard work,＿Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Hola. Primero, quizá debería agradecerte＿tu esfuerzo, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「Now that you got this ending, the＿reason I brought you here......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ahora que llegaste a este final, la＿razón por la que te traje aquí......」"

msgid "Yuri「......is none other than to discuss the＿route you chose. I thought we could＿ponder it together.」"
msgstr "Yuri「......es hablar de la ruta que＿elegiste. Pensé que podríamos＿reflexionar juntos.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well then, let's evaluate the ending you＿just saw.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, evaluemos el final＿que acabas de ver.」"

msgid "Yuri「Welcome, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bienvenido, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well then, let's begin to evaluate the＿ending you just saw.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, empecemos a evaluar el＿final que acabas de ver.」"

msgid "Yuri「Ah～... I see. It's the same as ever, not a＿care in the world...... Hmm.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ah～... Ya veo. Todo sigue igual,＿sin preocupaciones...... Hmm.」"

msgid "Yuri「Well, this kind of unchanging, unending＿everyday life isn't too bad, you know.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bueno, esta vida cotidiana que＿nunca cambia ni termina no está＿tan mal, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Yuri「Maybe after this, we'll have ski class......＿What do you think?」"
msgstr "Yuri「Tal vez luego tengamos clases de＿esquí...... ¿Qué te parece?」"

msgid "Yuri「Now then. If I were to grade this＿ending, I guess I'd give it 65 points. I＿want you to try just a little bit harder.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Si tuviera que calificar este final,＿le daría 65 puntos. Quiero que te＿esfuerces un poco más.」"

msgid "Yuri「Okay, that's all for today. Until next＿time!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Bien, eso es todo por hoy.＿¡Hasta la próxima!」"

msgid "『Music』 is now available in 『Extra』"
msgstr "『Música』 ya está disponible en 『Extras』"

msgid "『Album』 is now available in 『Extra』"
msgstr "『Álbum』 ya está disponible en 『Extras』"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga's working hard towards＿becoming self-reliant, she didn't give＿out her contact info after getting mine,」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga se esfuerza por ser independiente,＿no me dio sus datos de contacto tras＿obtener los míos,」"

msgid "Ryuuji「she's busy right now, she's in the＿middle of something, all of that crap......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「está ocupada, está haciendo algo,＿y todas esas tonterías......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Once, while Yasuko and I were out of＿the house, we came back to find a＿paper bag on the threshold with my」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Una vez, Yasuko y yo salimos y, al＿volver, encontramos en la entrada＿una bolsa de papel con mi」"

msgid "Ryuuji「scarf and a scribbled note inside.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「bufanda y una nota garabateada dentro.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kitamura and the other guys＿sometimes called to ask me how I'm＿doing, but my mind was as cloudy as a」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kitamura y los demás a veces llamaban＿a preguntar cómo estaba, pero mi mente＿estaba nublada como una」"

msgid "Ryuuji「sandstorm. With no way to repay their＿concern, I ended up not doing anything＿at all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「tormenta de arena. Sin poder＿corresponder a su preocupación,＿terminé sin hacer nada.」"

msgid "Minori「......Suddenly, my ears caught the sound＿of the clock's second hand. I had gone＿to bed at 8:52 PM. You could say the」"
msgstr "Minori「......De pronto, oí el segundero del＿reloj. Me había acostado a las 8:52＿p. m. Se podría decir que la」"

msgid "Minori「night was still young. My family, of＿course, was still awake.」"
msgstr "Minori「noche apenas empezaba. Mi familia,＿por supuesto, seguía despierta.」"

msgid "Minori「But something was off. Something was＿looming. What was this pressure? My＿body was worn out from working, but」"
msgstr "Minori「Pero algo iba mal. Algo se acercaba.＿¿Qué era esa presión? Mi cuerpo estaba＿agotado de trabajar, pero」"

msgid "Minori「my mind was pulled back from the＿brink of slumber.」"
msgstr "Minori「mi mente retrocedió desde＿el borde del sueño.」"

msgid "Minori「A tingling apprehension spread＿throughout my body, and my flushed＿cheeks were drenched in an」"
msgstr "Minori「Una inquietud punzante me recorrió＿el cuerpo y mis mejillas sonrojadas＿se empaparon de un」"

msgid "Minori「unpleasant sweat. At last, with grim＿determination, I looked in that＿direction.」"
msgstr "Minori「sudor desagradable. Al fin,＿con sombría determinación,＿miré en esa dirección.」"

msgid "Noto「Kushieda's jokes are lame, Tiger's＿clingy as always, Haruta's a moron, and＿you're straining your ears while you」"
msgstr "Noto「Las bromas de Kushieda son malas,＿Tigre sigue pegajosa, Haruta es un＿idiota y tú aguzas el oído mientras」"

msgid "Noto「clean. Oh, and did you finish your＿homework?」"
msgstr "Noto「limpias. Ah, ¿y terminaste tu tarea?」"

msgid "Noto「I'm not expecting anything, man. I was＿all excited, wondering how this school＿year would be different. But you greet」"
msgstr "Noto「No espero nada, amigo. Estaba＿emocionado, pensando qué cambiaría＿este año escolar. Pero saludas」"

msgid "Noto「everyone the same as always.」"
msgstr "Noto「a todos como siempre.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Back then, it wasn't \"her\" heart - but＿mine - that I wished to open. I was＿finally able to tell myself that I was」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En ese momento, no quería abrir el＿corazón de \"ella\", sino el mío. Al fin＿pude admitir que estaba」"

msgid "Ryuuji「overthinking things.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「pensándolo demasiado.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Besides, despite my worry, Taiga and＿Kushieda were fine. They were past＿the stage in which I would need to」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Además, pese a mi preocupación, Taiga＿y Kushieda estaban bien. Ya habían＿superado la etapa en que debía」"

msgid "Ryuuji「interfere. So there's no rush.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「intervenir. Así que no había prisa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I imagined myself on the sandy shores＿of Okinawa, like in the ending of some＿movie, the beautiful beach stretching」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Me imaginé en la arena de Okinawa,＿como al final de una película, con＿la hermosa playa extendida」"

msgid "Ryuuji「as far as the eye can see.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「hasta donde alcanza la vista.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't see Kitamura and Kawashima＿around, but I'm sure they'll get to＿school soon. Before long, the school」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No veo a Kitamura ni a Kawashima, pero＿seguro llegarán pronto a clases. En＿poco tiempo, en la escuela」"

msgid "Ryuuji「bells will chime, and my mundane life＿will begin.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「sonarán las campanas y empezará＿mi vida cotidiana.」"

msgid "Yuri「I'll come and see you every time you＿reach an ending.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Vendré a verte cada vez que＿llegues a un final.」"

msgid "Yuri「I want you to reflect on the actions you＿made this time and keep them in mind＿for next time.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Quiero que reflexiones sobre lo＿que hiciste esta vez y lo tengas＿en cuenta para la próxima.」"
